---
import LegalLayout from '@layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { SITE, mailHref } from '@data/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How PTCA collects, uses and protects the personal information you provide through enrolment and contact forms, including retention, cookies and your rights."
  updated="10 April 2026"
>
  <p>
    {SITE.legalName} ("PTCA", "we") respects your privacy. This policy explains
    what information we collect when you submit an enrolment or enquiry form, why
    we collect it, and the choices available to you.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>When you submit a form on this website we may collect:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your full name</li>
    <li>Your mobile or WhatsApp number</li>
    <li>Your email address</li>
    <li>Your city and area</li>
    <li>Your highest level of education and current professional status</li>
    <li>The course, learning mode and batch timing you are interested in</li>
    <li>Any message you choose to send us</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Optional details such as CNIC, date of birth and experience are collected only
    when required for registration and certification, and are collected at the
    time of admission rather than through the website form.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use your information</h2>
  <p>We use your details only to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Respond to your enquiry and confirm fees, batch dates and registration</li>
    <li>Provide the course and materials you have enrolled in</li>
    <li>Send batch updates and relevant academic information</li>
    <li>Maintain our internal student records and issue certificates</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we do not do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We do not sell, rent or trade your personal information.</li>
    <li>We do not send unsolicited marketing messages.</li>
    <li>We do not share your details with unrelated third parties.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Legal basis and data protection</h2>
  <p>
    We handle personal data in line with the principles set out in Pakistan's
    Electronic Transactions Act, 2016 (PECA) and applicable data protection
    legislation. Your information is stored securely and accessed only by staff
    who need it for admissions and teaching purposes.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of the personal
    information we hold about you. To make a request, email us at{' '}
    <a href={mailHref}>{SITE.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    This website uses only the cookies necessary to operate the site, such as
    remembering your enrolment form progress. We do not use advertising cookies
    without your consent.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    For any privacy question, contact us at <a href={mailHref}>{SITE.email}</a>{' '}
    or write to {SITE.address.singleLine}.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>